  "releaseNotes": "## Changes since 9.0.x\n\n### All packages\n* Added Trimming Support\n* Added AoT Compatibility Support\n* Addressed compiler warnings\n\n### Memory Package\n* Added ``Reverse`` extension for ``Memory<T>``, ``ReadOnlySpan<T>``, and ``ReadOnlyMemory<T>``\n* Converted package to use global usings\n* Added Span ``AsReadOnlySpan`` and Memory ``AsReadOnlyMemory`` methods\n* Added more Argument Exception throwing in case Empty or Whitespace Span or Memory objects are passed to methods",
